Note on third-party software:

This project does NOT bundle VOSviewer or any Java runtime. It downloads them
at the user's request from their official sources:

  - VOSviewer: https://www.vosviewer.com/download
    (VOSviewer is developed by Nees Jan van Eck and Ludo Waltman at CWTS,
     Leiden University. Its website states the software "can be used freely
     for any purpose". Users are responsible for complying with its terms.)

  - Java runtime: Azul Zulu builds of OpenJDK (GPLv2 with Classpath Exception)
    https://cdn.azul.com/

This project also does NOT redistribute VOSviewer's official sample data files.
